* "Could my psoriasis medication be contributing to my nighttime palpitations or interacting with my hypertension medications (metformin/empagliflozin) or gabapentin?"
* "Are there newer biologic or topical treatments for psoriasis that might be better suited for someone with my health profile?"
* "If we change my psoriasis medication, what side effects should I watch out for, particularly regarding my blood pressure and sleep?"

### 3. General Care Coordination
